    "summary": "CRYPTEK models in your army have [ASSAULT] on their ranged weapons. In addition, whenever you pick a CRYPTEK unit to shoot in your Shooting phase, choose one of [HEAVY], [ASSAULT], [IGNORES COVER], [ANTI-MOUNTED 4+] or [ANTI-INFANTRY 3+]: until that phase ends, ranged weapons carried by that unit's models have the chosen ability.",
